{"id":"STm00_02","names":{"avg1_103":"Amber","avg1_111":"Iris","0":"","avg1_1207":"Iris","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_999":"???","avg1_112":"Noya"},"en":{"avg1_103":"Amber","avg1_111":"Iris","0":"","avg1_1207":"Iris","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_999":"???","avg1_112":"Noya"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Prólogo","El comienzo","Las chicas del Gremio Nueva Estrella, que están en la ruina, te llevan a ti, una persona amnésica, a subir a otro Monolito, donde su deseo hace surgir un Artefacto, algo a la vez familiar y ajeno para ti."],["se","vo_STm00_02_000"],["say","0","♪~==W==♪~==W==♫~==W==♫~==W==♪~==W==♪~==W==♫~==W==♫~",9,""],["w",0.4],["goon"],["w",0.4],["goon"],["w",0.4],["goon"],["w",1.85],["goon"],["w",0.4],["goon"],["w",0.4],["goon"],["w",0.55],["goon"],["w",0.6],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.3],["choice",["..."],[[]]],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.1],["se","se_115"],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_999","¡Oye, Iris! ¿Cómo está la persona que salió de la caja?",0,"vo_STm00_02_001"],["bgm","m31"],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_999","El pulso y la temperatura son normales. La respiración también es estable.",0,"vo_STm00_02_002"],["w",0.3],["say","avg3_999","Qué bien. Ah, y esa melodía de hace un rato... ¿no era la que tarareaba la tía Allie? ¿Por qué se te ocurrió?",0,"vo_STm00_02_003"],["say","avg3_999","Solo estaba recordando algo. Una vez, cuando era pequeña, me caí y me lastimé, y la tía Allie me cantó esa canción. El dolor simplemente... desapareció, como por arte de magia.",0,"vo_STm00_02_004"],["say","avg3_999","Así que pensé que si la cantaba ahora, quizá ayudaría a esta persona a sentirse mejor también...",0,"vo_STm00_02_005"],["w",0.3],["choice",["Abre los ojos"],[[]]],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.3],["bgm",""],["fx",0,"fx_avg_eye_ev",0,0],["bg","story_main_01_007_i",0,3.0],["cbg",0,500.0,820.0,1.7,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,735.0,null,"Linear",4.0,null,null,null],["w",3.0],["bg","story_main_01_007_l",0,1.5],["w",3.0],["say","avg3_999","Oh, ==SEX== ya despertó.",9,"vo_STm00_02_006"],["w",0.8],["bg","story_main_01_007_o",0,0.8],["w",0.6],["say","avg3_999","¿¡Queeé!? ¡Bien hecho, Iris!",9,"vo_STm00_02_007"],["choice",["¿Quiénes... son ustedes?"],[[]]],["w",0.1],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.3],["bgm","m2"],["bg","story_main_01_007_k",0,0.8],["cbg",0,550.0,-50.0,1.45,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["say","avg3_999","No te preocupes. Nosotras también somos Trekkers.",9,"vo_STm00_02_008"],["bg","story_main_01_007_o",0,0.8],["cbg",0,550.0,-50.0,1.45,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["say","avg3_999","Sacamos una Caja de Deseos del Monolito, y cuando la abrimos, tú estabas dentro.",9,"vo_STm00_02_009"],["w",0.3],["bg","story_main_01_007_l",0,0.8],["cbg",0,-900.0,475.0,1.9,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["say","avg1_112","¡Hola! ¡Soy Noya! ¡Mucho gusto!",9,"vo_STm00_02_010"],["w",0.3],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.75],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["stg",5,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","story_main_01_007_g",5,0.0],["cbg",5,-100.0,-390.0,1.9,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stage",5,0,16],["say","avg1_112","¡Y la que está arriba del vehículo es Amber!",9,"vo_STm00_02_011"],["w",0.3],["bg","story_main_01_007_m",5,0.8],["cbg",5,-100.0,-390.0,1.9,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["bg","story_main_01_007_d",5,0.5],["cbg",5,-100.0,-390.0,1.9,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stage",5,1,17],["w",0.3],["bg","story_main_01_007_d",0,0.7],["cbg",0,550.0,-50.0,1.45,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","¡E Iris es quien te explicó todo hace un momento!",9,"vo_STm00_02_012"],["w",0.3],["bg","story_main_01_007_i",0,0.7],["cbg",0,-1000.0,385.0,1.8,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Por cierto, ¿viniste sin compañía? ¿No hay nadie de tu equipo contigo?",9,"vo_STm00_02_013"],["w",0.3],["bg","story_main_01_007_b",0,0.8],["cbg",0,550.0,-50.0,1.45,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.8],["say","avg1_111","Oye, Noya. ¿Qué tal si le bajas un poco a las preguntas?",9,"vo_STm00_02_014"],["bg","story_main_01_007_g",0,0.8],["cbg",0,-1000.0,385.0,1.8,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","¡Ay, perdón! ¡Es que me sorprendí mucho, ¿sabes?!",9,"vo_STm00_02_015"],["say","avg1_112","Es que la caja se abrió y ahí estabas tú, durmiendo a pierna suelta. Iris hasta dijo: «¡Quizá es un Artefacto humanoide!» y empezó a examinarte de pies a cabeza.",9,"vo_STm00_02_016"],["choice",["¿De pies a cabeza?"],[[]]],["w",0.1],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.3],["se","se_070"],["bg","story_main_01_007_b",0,0.8],["cbg",0,550.0,-50.0,1.45,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["w",0.6],["say","avg1_111","¡Ejem! ¡Solo comprobaba si eras una persona o un Artefacto, nada más!",9,"vo_STm00_02_017"],["say","avg1_111","¡J-Juro que no hice nada raro!",9,"vo_STm00_02_018"],["w",0.3],["bg","story_main_01_007_o",0,0.8],["w",0.6],["bgm",""],["choice",["Gracias por salvarme."],[[]]],["w",0.1],["choice",["Yo soy..."],[[]]],["w",0.1],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.8],["w",0.6],["choice",["Espera... ¿quién soy?"],[[]]],["w",0.3],["say","0","Media hora después...",8,""],["w",0.6],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.3],["bg","story_main_01_024_FP",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm","m1"],["choice",["¿Así que este soy yo...?"],[[]]],["w",0.1],["choice",["No recuerdo nada..."],[[]]],["w",0.1],["say","avg1_112","Entonces, oye, ¿te suena mi cara? Tengo la sensación de que ya nos conocimos en alguna parte.",9,"vo_STm00_02_019"],["w",0.3],["bg","luckyoasis_forest_daylight",0,0.7],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_112","a","002",null,-0.03,1.05,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.45],["w",0.45],["mrt",2,"y","021","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","¿Antes? Si hubiera conocido a alguien tan linda como tú, seguro que no la habría olvidado.==W== Lo siento, no me viene nada a la mente.",1,""],["w",0.8],["mrt",0,"z","002","attention","daintou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.45],["ctl","avg1_112","a","007","attention",null,-0.085,1.15,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_112","¿¡Eh!? ¿¡L-Linda!? ¡Ay, no, no digas esas cosas así de repente, me da vergüenza!",0,"vo_STm00_02_020"],["w",0.3],["mrt",1,"z","015","question",null],["say","avg3_100","No creo haber dicho nada tan raro...",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Como sea, no recuerdo mi nombre, ni sus caras, ni por qué estaba en esa caja.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.45],["stg",0,250.0,null,1.2,"OutSine",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_103","a","007",0.24,-0.085,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,"exclamation",0.28,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_103","Amnesia.",0,"vo_STm00_02_021"],["w",0.3],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.0,"OutSine",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_111","a","004",0.78,-0.085,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,"sigh",0.72,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","Eso parece.",0,"vo_STm00_02_022"],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_112","a","004","happy",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_112","Bueno, para nosotras es como un riesgo del oficio.",0,"vo_STm00_02_023"],["w",0.3],["mrt",2,"z","025","symbol",null],["say","avg3_100","¿Amnesia? Lo dices como si fuera algo muy común.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.45],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["hide","avg1_103",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["hide","avg1_111",0.4],["stg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutSine",0.6,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","a","015","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_112","Es que ser Trekker y perder la memoria casi siempre van de la mano.",0,"vo_STm00_02_024"],["choice",["¿A qué te refieres?"],[[]]],["w",0.1],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.4],["stg",0,-300.0,null,1.35,"OutSine",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_111","a","004",0.74,-0.01,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","Los Trekkers escalan Monolitos, piden deseos con las Cajas de Deseos y reciben poderosos Artefactos.==W== Pero a cambio, el Monolito les arrebata una parte de su memoria.",0,"vo_STm00_02_025"],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_111","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["goon"],["w",0.3],["clear",1,0.4,1],["stg",0,-360.0,null,null,"Linear",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.3],["bg","luckyoasis_forest_daylight",0,0.7],["cbg",0,-100.0,80.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_1207","a","007",0.625,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_1207","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","Tu situación es justo lo que eso parece. Lo ideal sería llevarte directo de vuelta a la ciudad, pero...",0,"vo_STm00_02_026"],["say","avg1_111","Tampoco podemos irnos con las manos vacías, así que vamos camino a otro Monolito.",0,"vo_STm00_02_027"],["ctl","avg1_1207","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_111","Así que... lo sentimos mucho,==W== pero te agradeceríamos que viajaras con nosotras un rato.",0,"vo_STm00_02_028"],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_1207","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.3],["stg",0,-300.0,null,null,"Linear",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.3],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.6],["w",0.6],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","luckyoasis_forest_daylight",0,0.0],["show","avg1_112","a","004",0.57,-0.03,1.05,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.6],["w",0.2],["say","avg1_112","Además, por aquí hay muchos monstruos, así que no es muy seguro que te quedes a solas en el vehículo. Pero no te preocupes. ¡Te protegeremos!",0,"vo_STm00_02_029"],["w",0.3],["stg",0,220.0,null,1.2,"OutSine",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.3],["se","se_061"],["show","avg1_103","a","003",0.3,0.03,1.05,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,null,null,-0.09,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_103","a","007",null,null,-0.03,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_103","Acabaremos con cualquier monstruo o Stellaroid que se nos cruce.",0,"vo_STm00_02_030"],["w",0.3],["mrt",2,"z","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","No parece que tenga mucha opción. Ir a ese tal Monolito quizá me ayude a recuperar algunos recuerdos.",1,""],["mrt",0,"y","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Pero sobre lo que acabas de decir...",1,""],["bgm",""],["mrt",0,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Si pides un deseo, podrías terminar con amnesia como yo, ¿verdad?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.6],["w",0.6],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.0],["choice",["¿No da... miedo?"],[[]]],["w",0.1],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","luckyoasis_forest_daylight",0,0.0],["show","avg1_103","a","012",0.3,-0.06,1.1,0,null,null],["show","avg1_111","a","002",null,-0.06,1.1,0,null,null],["show","avg1_112","a","015",0.7,-0.06,1.1,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.6],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","a","004","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_111","Jaja... Bueno, mentiría si dijera que no tengo miedo.",0,"vo_STm00_02_031"],["bgm","m28"],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,null,0.25,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["hide","avg1_103",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,0.75,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.4],["ctl","avg1_111","a","017","exclamation",null,-0.15,1.25,null,null,"OutSine",0.4],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_111","Pero, sinceramente, lo que da más miedo ahora que perder la memoria es que no tenemos dinero para sobrevivir un día más.",0,"vo_STm00_02_032"],["w",1.5],["bgm",""],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.3],["end"]]}